{"id":"vospitanie","lemma":"воспитание","pos":"noun","rank":4430,"glosses":["education, upbringing","training"],"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/e/ec/Ru-%D0%B2%D0%BE%D1%81%D0%BF%D0%B8%D1%82%D0%B0%D0%BD%D0%B8%D0%B5.ogg/Ru-%D0%B2%D0%BE%D1%81%D0%BF%D0%B8%D1%82%D0%B0%D0%BD%D0%B8%D0%B5.ogg.mp3","gender":"n","forms":{"genitive":"воспитания","plural":"воспитания"},"examples":[{"text":"Воспитание начинается дома.","en":"Education begins at home.","words":[null,null,{"g":"at home"}]},{"text":"Воспитание начинается в семье.","en":"Education begins at home.","words":[null,null,{"g":"in"},null]},{"text":"Воспитание ребёнка — большой труд.","en":"Raising a child is a big job.","words":[null,{"g":"child","l":"ребёнок"},{"g":"big, large, great"},{"g":"work, labor/labour"}]},{"text":"Лишь намного позже я осознал важность воспитания детей.","en":"It was only much later that I came to understand the importance of child education.","words":[{"g":"only, merely, just"},{"g":"by far, much"},null,{"g":"I"},{"g":"to recognize","l":"осознать"},{"g":"importance"},null,{"g":"child","l":"ребёнок"}]},{"text":"У вас есть преимущество в виде хорошего воспитания.","en":"You have the advantage of a good education.","words":[{"g":"at / by"},{"g":"you","l":"вы"},{"g":"there is / to eat"},{"g":"advantage"},null,null,null,null],"phrases":[[4,6,"in the form of"]]}]}